{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I need to carefully parse this puzzle. Let me break it down:\n\n1. A book (Book A) was a contender for an award\n2. The award itself was originally created in the 2000s\n3. Book A was translated into over 25 languages\n4. In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won that same award\n5. Book B had been released the preceding year\n6. The author of Book B was born in the same city where the author of Book A grew up\n7. Question: In what city was the author of Book A born?\n\nLet me start searching for clues about awards created in the 2000s and books translated into many languages.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"award created 2000s literary prize translated twenty five languages\", \"book translated over 25 languages award contender 2010s\", \"literary prize founded 2000s international award\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_43566ff23308412b9016bd9c","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"book award founded 2000s contender translated many languages\", \"author born city grew up prize winning book preceding year\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_56ef028a29da4955804bfd93","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789474911,"id":"chatcmpl-f7bd5880-3a0f-90d8-8a47-31ebbfe41742","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":3870,"completion_tokens":249,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4119,"cached_tokens":0,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}